1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:05,150
The stair is not a path.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:10,450
It shows when the water leaves.

3
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:18,350
The first pull misses the hour.

4
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:26,100
4:10. One window.

5
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:34,500
Walk it before the tide comes back.

6
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:39,900
Then the sheet is the only stair left.
